    "items": [
      {
        "body": "With stt_idle_seconds under 60 a Parakeet reload after an idle unload skips its warm-up: last_recognized survives the unload, so WARM_UP_SKIP fires for a fresh process. Reproduced on both reloads (runs/fu-idle5). No visible cost on a current shader cache; after a driver or engine update a take past 40 s would compile its own kernels. The default of 300 s cannot trigger it. (surface: crates/dettivo-speech/src/supervisor_warm.rs)",
